/// \defgroup grp_living_world Living World
/// \brief The War of the Ring campaign: campaign logic, regions, armies,
///        battles and auto-resolve, campaign acts, and the strategic map's
///        client side and Apt HUD.
///
/// Campaign state lives in `LivingWorldLogic` and the stores registered
/// beside it in `GameEngine::init`. The client manager and the HUD present
/// it, but the manager also holds settings and state that the logic reads
/// and saves, so the two sides are coupled. \ref sub_living_world describes
/// the subsystem, its data and its differences from Zero Hour and BFME 1.
